<title>UK: Morgan Crucible buys Great Lakes unit.</title>
<headline>Morgan Crucible buys Great Lakes unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Morgan Crucible Co Plc said on Wednesday it had bought EM Corp, a unit of U.S. group Great Lakes Chemical Corp, for $26.8 million in cash.</p>
</text>
